<section class='founder-story' aria-labelledby='story-heading'>
  <h2 id='story-heading'>My Story</h2>
  <div class='story-content'>
    <div class='story-image'>
      <img
        src='/logos-and-images/Business Photo - Small.JPG'
        alt='Jennifer, founder of JMJ Financial Coaching'
        width='400'
        height='400'
        loading='lazy'
      />
    </div>
    <div class='story-text'>
      <p>
        Three years ago, I suddenly lost my job and our household income was cut in half overnight. We were really
        scared. But putting together a budget changed everything. We made some lifestyle changes, and I got to achieve
        our dream of me being a stay at home mom.
      </p>
      <p>
        That experience of fear and then finding peace through taking control of our money is why I became a financial
        coach. I want to help you find that same peace and reach your goals, just like we did.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder-story {
    padding-block: var(--space-16);
    background-color: var(--color-bg-muted, #fafafa);
  }

  .founder-story h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
    font-size: clamp(var(--font-size-2xl), 4vw, var(--font-size-3xl));
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .story-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .story-image {
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  }

  .story-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .story-text {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .story-text p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .story-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
